    <main id="main-content">
        <section class="fasting-21-hero">
            <h1>⛰️ 21 Days of Breakthrough</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Daniel's Fast: A Journey of Spiritual Warfare and Divine Revelation</p>
            <div class="breakthrough-badge">✨ Seeking God's Breakthrough ✨</div>
        </section>

        <section class="content-page">
            <div class="content-page-body">
                <div
                    style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0f2fe 0%, #f0f9ff 100%); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 20px; border-left: 6px solid #0ea5e9; margin: 2rem 0; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.15); position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
                    <div style="position: absolute; top: 10px; right: 10px; font-size: 4rem; opacity: 0.1;">📖</div>
                    <div
                        style="display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; position: relative; z-index: 1;">
                        <span style="font-size: 4rem; color: #0ea5e9; line-height: 1;">📜</span>
                        <div>
                            <p
                                style="font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.35rem; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8; color: #1e3a8a; margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-weight: 500;">
                                "In those days I, Daniel, was mourning three full weeks. I ate no pleasant food, no meat
                                or wine came into my mouth, nor did I anoint myself at all, till three whole weeks were
                                fulfilled."
                            </p>
                            <p
                                style="text-align: right; color: #0ea5e9; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0;">
                                — Daniel 10:2-3 (NKJV)
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div
                    style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.08) 0%, rgba(118, 75, 162, 0.08) 100%); padding: 3rem; border-radius: 25px; margin: 3rem 0; border: 3px solid rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2);">
                    <h2
                        style="color: #667eea; font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-align: center; font-weight: 800;">
                        🌟 The Power of Daniel's Fast</h2>
                    <p
                        style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-align: center; max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
                        Daniel's 21-day fast was a time of deep spiritual seeking that resulted in angelic visitation
                        and prophetic revelation. This fast is ideal for those seeking God's direction, breakthrough in
                        spiritual warfare, or deeper intimacy with Christ.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div
                    style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; margin: 3rem 0;">
                    <div
                        style="background: white; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-top: 5px solid #667eea; transition: transform 0.3s;">
                        <div style="font-size: 3.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-align: center;">⚔️</div>
                        <h3
                            style="color: #667eea; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-align: center; font-weight: 700;">
                            Spiritual Warfare</h3>
                        <p style="color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.8; text-align: center;">
                            Break through spiritual opposition and experience victory in areas where you've been
                            battling.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div
                        style="background: white; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-top: 5px solid #764ba2; transition: transform 0.3s;">
                        <div style="font-size: 3.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-align: center;">🔮</div>
                        <h3
                            style="color: #764ba2; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-align: center; font-weight: 700;">
                            Divine Revelation</h3>
                        <p style="color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.8; text-align: center;">
                            Receive clarity, wisdom, and prophetic insight for the decisions and challenges you face.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div
                        style="background: white; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-top: 5px solid #0ea5e9; transition: transform 0.3s;">
                        <div style="font-size: 3.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-align: center;">💫</div>
                        <h3
                            style="color: #0ea5e9; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-align: center; font-weight: 700;">
                            Deeper Intimacy</h3>
                        <p style="color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.8; text-align: center;">
                            Draw closer to God through consecration and experience His presence in powerful ways.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div
                    style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef3c7 0%, #fef9e6 100%); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 20px; margin: 3rem 0; border: 3px solid #fbbf24; box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2);">
                    <h3
                        style="color: #92400e; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; text-align: center;">
                        📋 What This 21-Day Journey Includes:</h3>
                    <ul style="color: #78350f; line-height: 2.2; font-size: 1.1rem; list-style: none; padding: 0;">
                        <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2);">📖
                            <strong>Daily Scripture Readings</strong> focused on breakthrough and spiritual victory</li>
                        <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2);">🙏
                            <strong>Guided Prayers</strong> for specific areas of spiritual warfare</li>
                        <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2);">💭
                            <strong>Reflection Questions</strong> for personal spiritual growth</li>
                        <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2);">🍎
                            <strong>Daniel Fast Guidelines</strong> with dietary recommendations and recipes</li>
                        <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2);">✨
                            <strong>Testimonies</strong> of breakthrough through fasting</li>
                        <li style="padding: 0.75rem 0;">🎯 <strong>Weekly Themes</strong>: Surrender, Purification,
                            Breakthrough</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div
                    style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0e7ff 0%, #f5f3ff 100%); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 20px; margin: 3rem 0; border-left: 6px solid #8b5cf6;">
                    <h3 style="color: #6d28d9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800;">🔥 The Three
                        Weeks of Transformation</h3>

                    <div style="margin: 2rem 0;">
                        <div
                            style="background: white; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 15px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);">
                            <h4 style="color: #8b5cf6; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700;">
                                Week 1: Surrender 🙌</h4>
                            <p style="color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;">
                                Lay down your burdens, desires, and plans at the feet of Jesus. Learn to trust God
                                completely as you begin this journey of consecration.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div
                            style="background: white; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 15px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);">
                            <h4 style="color: #8b5cf6; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700;">
                                Week 2: Purification 🔥</h4>
                            <p style="color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;">
                                Allow God's refining fire to purify your heart, mind, and spirit. Experience spiritual
                                cleansing and renewal as you seek His face.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div
                            style="background: white; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);">
                            <h4 style="color: #8b5cf6; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700;">
                                Week 3: Breakthrough ⚡</h4>
                            <p style="color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;">
                                Stand in faith as God brings breakthrough in your circumstances. Receive divine
                                revelation, healing, and answers to prayer.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div
                    style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fce7f3 0%, #fef2f2 100%); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 15px; margin: 3rem 0; border: 2px solid #f472b6;">
                    <h4 style="color: #be185d; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700;">💡 Important
                        Note:</h4>
                    <p style="color: #9f1239; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;">
                        <strong>The Daniel Fast is a partial fast</strong> focusing on vegetables, fruits, whole grains,
                        nuts, and water while abstaining from meat, dairy, sweets, and processed foods. Always consult
                        with your doctor before beginning any fast, especially if you have health conditions. This fast
                        is about spiritual seeking, not physical deprivation.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div
                    style="text-align: center; padding: 3rem 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.05) 0%, rgba(118, 75, 162, 0.05) 100%); border-radius: 25px; margin: 3rem 0;">
                    <h3 style="color: #667eea; font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800;">🚀 Ready to
                        Begin Your Journey?</h3>
                    <p
                        style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; line-height: 1.8;">
                        While we prepare the complete 21-day devotional guide, continue in daily devotion and prepare
                        your heart for this powerful spiritual journey.
                    </p>
                    <a href="daily-devotion.html"
                        style="display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2); color: white; padding: 1.25rem 3rem; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4); transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;">
                        📖 Read Daily Devotion
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
